pan>: Sounds good.", "id": 5, "time": "29500"}, {"image": "engenn2le05ob11re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Conversation 2</span> <br>", "id": 6, "time": "33000"}, {"image": "engenn2le05ob11re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Hi, Vanessa. We're driving to your place now. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  We?", "id": 7, "time": "33000"}, {"image": "engenn2le05ob11re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  John and Sally are coming today as well.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  That's great! Sally and I can talk on the way.", "id": 8, "time": "37500"}, {"image": "engenn2le05ob11re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You two talk all the time!<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Not that often! Where are you now?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  We're on your street.<br />", "id": 9, "time": "43000"}]}}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn2le05ob11re2aud02", "coverimg": "", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "Conversation 1", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Peter</span>: \u00a0Hi Vanessa. We're driving to your place now.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \u00a0We?", "id": 1, "time": "10"}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Peter</span>: \u00a0John and Sally are coming today as well.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \u00a0That's great! Sally and I can talk on the way.", "id": 2, "time": "300"}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Peter</span>: You two talk all the time!<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \u00a0Not that often! Where are you now?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Peter</span>: \u00a0We're on your street.", "id": 3, "time": "8500"}]}}], "id": 2}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar"}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Out and About", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Around Town", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > How to Master Small Talk > Pronunciation", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 5, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people, their likes and dislikes, homes or countries in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "  The Present Continuous Tense for Future Meaning", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Present Continuous tense to talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future.<br/>The Present Continuous tense also talks about actions happening now.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"2\",\"columns\":\"2\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous (for now)<span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous (for the future)<span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hi! Where are you going?<br/><br/>He's reading the newspaper.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">They're going to the beach on Saturday.<br/><br/>She's seeing a movie with Tom tonight.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class = \"strong\">Kirk</span>: What are you doing tomorrow?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Jessica</span>: I'm going to the beach.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " The Modal Can for Ability, Possibility and Permission", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the modal <span class = \"strong\">can</span> to ask and talk about what is possible.  <br/>Example: <span class = \"italic\">I can buy him a tie!</span>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class = \"strong\">Possibility</span>: Can you show me those ties?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class = \"strong\">Ability</span>: I can speak English!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class = \"strong\">Permission</span>: <br/><span class = \"strong\">Alice</span>: Can I smoke here?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Mark</span>: No, you can't smoke here. You can smoke in the garden.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You use the modal <span class = \"strong\">can</span> to say you have an ability or know how to  do something. <br/><br/>You can use the modal <span class = \"strong\">can</span> to ask for permission or give someone permission.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to eat out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to have a meal at a restaurant", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let's eat dinner out at Mario's tonight!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "often", "type": "name"}, {"content": "many times", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  We often go to the mall.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "all the time", "type": "name"}, {"content": "regularly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have sandwiches for lunch all the time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to see", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to watch", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let's see a movie.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "event", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an important activity that happens", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They have a sports event here once a year.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Find an event near your city. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a short dialogue between you and a friend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say when the event takes place.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say where it is.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask to use a friend's car to go there.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your dialogue aloud with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write about an event near my city.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I say where and when the event is.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask permission to use a car.", "type": "text"}]}]}